By downloading, installing, copying, or using the Software, you agree to this agreement. If you do not agree, do not
download, install, or use it, and delete every copy you have. Wave Launcher also asks you to accept these terms before it
downloads or runs any macro.

You confirm that you are old enough to enter this agreement where you live, or that a parent or guardian has agreed to it
for you.

