for as long as this agreement allows. Access depends on a verified Wave account that belongs to you. Wave keeps all rights
not expressly granted here.

3. WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO

You may not, and may not let or help anyone else:

a. Crack, patch, hook, emulate, or otherwise defeat or bypass sign-in, authentication, sessions, account verification,
   access checks, licensing, update checks, signatures, integrity checks, install receipts, or any anti-tamper or
   protection measure, or run the Software without the checks it is meant to make.
b. Modify, adapt, translate, repackage, or create derivative works of the Software, or run a modified copy of it.
c. Reverse engineer, decompile, disassemble, deobfuscate, or otherwise try to obtain the source code, algorithms, tuning
   values, data formats, or network protocols of the Software, or inspect it to build something else.
d. Copy, share, upload, leak, publish, sell, rent, lend, sublicense, host, or distribute the Software, any part of it, its
   source code, or its builds, in any way and on any platform, including Discord, forums, file-hosting sites, code hosts,
