6. YOUR DATA

Wave records the information needed to run the service and protect it from abuse, as described in the terms and screens
inside the Software. This includes your Discord account ID and display name, your membership tier, a one-way hash of this
PC's hardware ID, the Roblox account last seen in Roblox's logs on this PC, and request logs. A macro may also send play
summaries to Wave if you agree to that in the macro. The Software never needs your passwords.

7. UPDATES AND CHANGES

The Software may update itself. Wave may change, suspend, or stop any part of the Software or service at any time. Wave may
update this agreement; you will be asked to accept a material change, and continuing to use the Software after that means
