This agreement ends automatically if you breach it. Wave may also suspend or end your access, including by blocking your
account or PC, at any time and for any reason, with or without notice. When it ends you must stop using the Software and
delete every copy. Sections 3, 4, 5, 9, 10, and 11 survive.

